msgid "Upgrade to Premium"
msgstr "Auf Premium upgraden"

#: ../inc/settings.php:714
msgid "Image Comparison"
msgstr "Bildvergleich"

#: ../inc/settings.php:715
msgid ""
"Slide between the original and squeezed image in the Media Library so you "
